    "angle": 0,
    "content": "2.3.17【柯西不等式法】"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.119,
      0.248,
      0.134
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲适用题型：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.148,
      0.732,
      0.17
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "常用于根式中有和为定值时，比如求 \\( f(x) = \\sqrt{m(x + p)} + \\sqrt{n(-x + q)} \\) 最大值；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.184,
      0.248,
      0.199
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲方法原理：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.206,
      0.302,
      0.221
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "1. 二维柯西不等式:",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.232,
      0.848,
      0.266
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "设 \\(a, b, c, d\\) 均为实数，有 \\((a^2 + b^2)(c^2 + d^2) \\geq (ac + bd)^2\\) 当且仅当 \\(\\frac{a}{c} = \\frac{b}{d}\\) 时等号成立；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.275,
      0.775,
      0.38
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "向量法证明： \\(\\begin{cases} \\vec{m} = (a,b),\\vec{n} = (c,d),|\\cos \\theta |\\leq 1 \\\\ \\Rightarrow |\\vec{m}\\cdot \\vec{n}| = \\left\\| \\vec{m}\\right\\| \\vec{n}\\left|\\cos \\theta \\right|\\leq \\left|\\vec{m}\\right\\| \\vec{n} \\\\ \\Rightarrow |ac + bd|\\leq \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\\sqrt{c^2 + d^2}\\\\ \\Rightarrow (a^2 +b^2)(c^2 +d^2)\\geq (ac + bd)^2 \\end{cases}\\) ；取等时向量共线，即 \\(\\frac{a}{c} = \\frac{b}{d}\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.39,
      0.461,
      0.406
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "解答题用到柯西不等式，即可用此证明；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.415,
      0.297,
      0.43
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "2. n 维柯西不等式:",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.439,
      0.831,
      0.46
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\((a_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2} + a_{3}^{2} + \\dots +a_{n}^{2})(b_{1}^{2} + b_{2}^{2} + b_{3}^{2} + \\dots +b_{n}^{2})\\geq (a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2} + a_{3}b_{3} + \\dots +a_{n}b_{n})^{2}\\) 字母均为 \\(\\mathsf{R}\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.473,
      0.638,
      0.508
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "当且仅当 \\(\\frac{a_1}{b_1} = \\frac{a_2}{b_2} = \\frac{a_3}{b_3} = \\dots = \\frac{a_n}{b_n}\\) 时等号成立，\\(\\mathsf{n}\\) 维向量证明；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.518,
      0.501,
      0.541
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "比如求 \\( f(x) = \\sqrt{m(x + p)} + \\sqrt{n(-x + q)} \\) 最大值：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.149,
      0.55,
      0.798,
      0.669
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\n\\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} {a = \\sqrt {m}, b = \\sqrt {n}, c = \\sqrt {x + p}, d = \\sqrt {- x + q}} \\\\ {\\sqrt {m (x + p)} + \\sqrt {n (- x + q)} \\leq \\sqrt {\\left(\\sqrt {m} ^ {2} + \\sqrt {n} ^ {2}\\right)} \\sqrt {\\left(\\sqrt {x + p} ^ {2} + \\sqrt {- x + q} ^ {2}\\right)} = \\sqrt {m + n} \\sqrt {q + q}} \\\\ {\\text {当且仅当} \\frac {\\sqrt {m}}{\\sqrt {x + p}} = \\frac {\\sqrt {n}}{\\sqrt {- x + q}} \\text {时取等};} \\end{array} \\right.\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.155,
      0.679,
      0.515,
      0.694
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(柯西的拓展权方和见不等式章节1.4的讲解)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.705,
      0.731,
      0.727
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "例题1.（全国·高一课时练习）函数 \\( y = \\sqrt{x - 5} + 2\\sqrt{6 - x} \\) 的最大值是（）",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
